Cell["\<\
On the bare distance shell the two points are joined by no arc: a shell of a \
lattice has no two adjacent vertices.\
\>", "ExampleText",ExpressionUUID->"05b8bd7b-c4b0-43dc-96a6-b16f9a8e5a1e"],

